<button class="filter-tab px-4 py-2 rounded-lg font-label-md text-label-md transition-all bg-surface-container text-on-surface-variant hover:bg-surface-container-high hover:text-on-surface" data-filter="viveros" type="button">
          Viveros &amp; Plantaciones
