<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-xl shrink-0" style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1;">check_circle</span>
<span class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface">Alegaciones SIGPAC y ajustes de recintos</span>
</div>
<div class="flex items-start gap-2.5 bg-surface-container-low p-3 rounded-lg">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-xl shrink-0" style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1;">check_circle</span>
